###############################################################################
# Create: Gunpowder - .gitignore for a Java / NeoForge Minecraft mod
###############################################################################

## Gradle build output
build/
.gradle/
gradletasknamecache
gradle-app.setting

# gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar is intentionally TRACKED. It is what lets a
# fresh clone run ./gradlew without Gradle installed, so never add a blanket
# *.jar rule here.

## Local maven repository, written by the publishing block in build.gradle
repo/

## IDE / editor cruft
.idea/
.vscode/
.vs/
out/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
.settings/
.metadata/
.classpath
.project
bin/
eclipse/
*.launch

## OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

## Development runtime
# Produced by launching the game: worlds, logs, crash reports, options, and the
# mods dropped into run/mods for testing. A world save in particular would be
# both large and meaningless to anyone else.
run/
runs/
run-data/

## Crash artefacts, wherever they land
crash-reports/
*.hprof
hs_err_pid*.log

###############################################################################
# Local-only working material. NOT for publication.
#
# external-files/ holds other-mods (third-party mod binaries the build compiles
# against and development runs load), plus context-files and bug-reports. The
# binaries are other people's work under other people's licences, several of
# which forbid redistribution. This mod is All Rights Reserved and ships none
# of them.
#
# photoshop/ is deliberately NOT ignored. It holds the layered sources for the
# mod icon and the store gallery, which are this project's own artwork and are
# tracked with it.
#
# Remove an entry only if you deliberately intend to publish it. See NOTICE.
###############################################################################
external-files/
context-files/
bug-reports/
NOTES.md
